  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Enchanted_Books/BH_BEB_header1.webp\" width=\"1452\" height=\"610\"></strong></span></span></a></span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本模组旨在改善附魔书的外观，现在每一本都将与众不同！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">我们还增加了对超过85个模组的支持，包括：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Ad Astra: Giselle Addon、Additional Additions、Additional Enchanted Miner、Alex's Caves、Alex's Caves: Stuff &amp; Torpedoes、Alex's Mobs、Alexs Caves Exemplified、Allurement、Apotheosis、Apothic Enchanting、Apothic Spawners、Ars Additions、Ars Elemental、Ars Nouveau、Arthropofia、AzureLib、Backpacked、Better Archeology、Better End、BetterNether、Biome Makeover、Box of Horros、Celestisynth、Clutter、CoFH Core、Combat Roll、Corail Tombstone、Create、Create Stuff &amp; Additions、Darker Depths、Death Knights、Deep Aether、Deeper and Darker、Draconic Evolution、Dungeons and Taverns、EnderIO、Ensorcellation、Eternal Starlight、EvilCraft、Farmer's Delight、Fins and Tails、Forbidden Arcanus、Galosphere、gofish、Golden Foods、Hunter's Return、Jaden's Nether Expansion、Just a lot more enchantments、Just Enough Guns、Kobolds、Malum、Midnight、MineColonies、My Nether Delight、Mystical Agriculture、Mythic Charms、MythicBotania、Nature's Aura、Nether Depths Upgrade、Opposint Forge、Piglin Proliferation、Railcraft Reborn、Reliquary Reincarnations、Species、Spawner+、Spell Engine、Spell Power Attribute、Stalwart Dungeons、Stellarity、Supplementaries、Terramity、The Bumblezone、The Deep Void、The End of Herobrine、The Twilight Forest、The Undergarden、The Undead Revamp、Things、Too Many Bows、Trials Chambers、Unusual Fish、UtilitiX、Vampirism、Vein Mining、When Dungeons Arise and You're in Grave Danger 和 Yomai Style。</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这是Minecraft社区无数次向创作者们提出的请求，因为这样一来，他们就能区分不同的附魔书了。为此，我们创建了这个精美的资源包，它拥有与每本书主题相关的独特纹理。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此前，我们发布过一个资源包，但从第一个版本开始，我们就收到了无数请求，希望将其转化为一个模组，并且不需要任何其他模组即可运行……现在，它来了！本模组不需要任何其他模组来修改书本的外观！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要一个服务器和朋友一起玩吗？</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Enchanted_Books/BH_BEB_promo.webp\" width=\"1492\" height=\"371\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果您正在寻找一个服务器来和朋友游玩任何模组或整合包，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a></span> 就是您的解决方案！他们提供最佳性价比的Minecraft服务器，如果点击<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong></span>并使用优惠码“Lupin”，您将获得25%的折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Enchanted_Books/BH_BEB_summary.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"229\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Beautiful Enchanted Books 的目标很简单，就是给所有Minecraft书本带来全新的外观——它们再也不会全都看起来一样乏味了！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此外，所有书本将根据主题或用途拥有相同的色调，当然还有独特的特征，使它们从其他书中脱颖而出。我们相信您一定会喜欢这些特性！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Enchanted_Books/BH_BEB_FAQ.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"243\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我需要安装资源包才能让模组运作吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然不需要！您不需要任何其他模组或资源包。只需下载本模组，就万事俱备了——书本的外观将会改变！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它能在服务器上运行吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！运行完美！请记住，与朋友一起玩模组的最佳方式是通过BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>点击此链接可享受25%折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个模组可以用在整合包中吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！前提是它只发布在Modrinth或CurseForge上。将其上传到任何其他平台将侵犯我们的权利，这是绝对不允许的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果您考虑将其添加到您的Modrinth或CurseForge整合包中，我们万分感激。如果您需要任何小改动或有任何疑问，请联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以录制本模组的视频并在我的频道上展示吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然，您可以在您的频道上自由游玩本模组或我们的任何整合包并录制视频，事实上，我们对此深表感谢！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Beautiful_Enchanted_Books/BH_BEB_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"243\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"http